2147
02:00:38,960 --> 02:00:47,960
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Pwede po ba natin para lang po humupa ang kanilang galit at mag-guarantee na hindi po bubuksan ang Hibusong to any mining operation?

2148
02:00:48,600 --> 02:00:51,080
Rep. Arlene "Kaka" J. Bag-ao: Sir, hindi po totoong walang mining operation.

2149
02:00:51,080 --> 02:00:58,860
