2155
02:01:23,700 --> 02:01:26,400
DENR Undersecretary for Field Operations and Line Bureaus Joselin Marcus E. Fragada: Give her a copy of the suspension order, ma'am.

2156
02:01:26,780 --> 02:01:27,580
