4121
03:45:57,360 --> 03:46:05,540
MGB Director Larry M. Heradez: Yung Nickelace, may tatlong operator, Verum Terra, Pacific Nickel, and yung Global Minmet po.

4122
03:46:05,660 --> 03:46:09,520
MGB Director Larry M. Heradez: Yung po yung mga nag-ooperate dyan sa dalawang MPSA.

4123
03:46:09,860 --> 03:46:13,440
MGB Director Larry M. Heradez: Meron din pong nag-ooperate dyan na MPSA.

4124
03:46:13,440 --> 03:46:21,000
