4385
04:05:00,480 --> 04:05:07,500
Rep. Maximo B. Rodriguez Jr.: So, the needed thing to replant or we call rehabilitate those planted already is 400 billion?

4386
04:05:09,000 --> 04:05:10,040
Rep. Maximo B. Rodriguez Jr.: 400 million?

4387
04:05:11,320 --> 04:05:12,520
FMB Director Arturo E. Fadriquela: 408 million.

4388
