4419
04:09:20,780 --> 04:09:21,540
Rep. Maximo B. Rodriguez Jr.: It can be.

4420
04:09:22,380 --> 04:09:23,480
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Cannot be transferred.

4421
04:09:23,980 --> 04:09:26,940
