4422
04:09:34,960 --> 04:09:37,860
Rep. Maximo B. Rodriguez Jr.: This is about your regulation.

4423
04:09:38,660 --> 04:09:58,860
Rep. Maximo B. Rodriguez Jr.: You know, the central office is the final approving authority as of now. But before, there was this department, administrative order, which prescribed the processing and approval in the district. I mean, in the regional office.

4424
04:09:59,340 --> 04:10:09,960
