4425
04:10:10,680 --> 04:10:17,300
Rep. Maximo B. Rodriguez Jr.: I talked with someone, they say it can be had by Zoom, by email.

4426
04:10:17,620 --> 04:10:24,940
Rep. Maximo B. Rodriguez Jr.: But, you know, if you go to the powerpoint, there's no email there. There's no facility for email. And so,

4427
04:10:25,430 --> 04:10:33,960
Rep. Maximo B. Rodriguez Jr.: I want you to revisit. I think it is DAO, it was approved last year, but then the previous one was several years ago.

4428
04:10:34,420 --> 04:10:37,400
Rep. Maximo B. Rodriguez Jr.: The one that was changed by Secretary Loizaga.

4429
04:10:38,300 --> 04:10:44,460
