04:12:14,680 --> 04:12:31,420
Rep. Maximo B. Rodriguez Jr.: With that, Chairman, I terminate my interpellation and again, in due time, we will move for the inclusion of that 400 million to the added budget. For DNR. And with your help, with your letter, we are going to push for it.

4439
04:12:31,700 --> 04:12:33,200
Rep. Maximo B. Rodriguez Jr.: Mabuhay ang DNR. Good afternoon.

4440
04:12:33,400 --> 04:12:34,480
