MGB Director Larry M. Heradez: Nagka-problema po.

8233
07:32:55,340 --> 07:33:04,920
MGB Director Larry M. Heradez: Kaya po nung 2021 or 2022, we issued a policy of prohibiting more than one.

8234
07:33:04,980 --> 07:33:08,420
MGB Director Larry M. Heradez: One operator, one MPSA po ang nilabas ng DENR.

8235
